        "FLUX + STYLE REFERENCE (Redux, core nodes only)\n\nModel files:\n- models/diffusion_models/flux1-dev.safetensors\n- models/text_encoders/clip_l.safetensors\n- models/text_encoders/t5xxl_fp8_e4m3fn.safetensors\n- models/vae/ae.safetensors\n- models/style_models/flux1-redux-dev.safetensors\n- models/clip_vision/sigclip_vision_patch14_384.safetensors\n\nPut your reference picture in ComfyUI/input/ as style_reference.png,\nor click \"choose file to upload\" on the Load Image node.\n\nRedux copies content as well as style. Apply Style Model strength\n(attn_bias) sets the balance: 0.3 = mostly your prompt,\n0.8 = close to the reference picture."
